# SpecKit artefacts.
#
# The upstream setup script appends this entry to the ROOT .gitignore directly. That file
# is rebuilt from .gitignore.d/ by base/gitignore, so an appended line is dropped on the
# next render and the artefact starts showing up in `git status`. Carrying it as a
# fragment is what makes it survive, the same fix agentic/beads applies to bd's own
# appended block.

# Regenerated on every /speckit.status-report run.
specs/**/spec-status.md
